OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FContinuing
OL,6,Fwith mainly cloudy skies this evening
OL,7,Fand overnight which occasionally
OL,8,Fthicken to bring a few light drizzly
OL,9,Fshowers. Winds light and variable in
OL,10,Fdirection.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy for much of the day,
OL,13,Fbut any light showers are likely to be
OL,14,Frestricted to the morning. Some chance
OL,15,Fof brighter spells developing later in
OL,16,Fthe day. Winds light.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,19,FOccasional brighter spells breaking
OL,20,Fthrough. Mainly dry with only a few
OL,21,Flight showers appearing. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
